.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK SPRINT ARCHIVE"
.SH NAME
hamstik sprint archive \- Archive a sprint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik sprint archive [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Archive a sprint
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Sprint id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
